"""Twenty-five individual coordinate completions and a narrow participation-definition correction."""
from copy import deepcopy
from best_guess_helpers import current_data,change,write_revision,DATE
from research_helpers import assessment
D=current_data();changes=[]
rows=[
('voyage-yesteryear-chiron',{'nonworking':(.45,[.1,.85],'Chiron all-age scenario: robot provision removes wage necessity, while useful art, technology, care and chosen projects continue.')},
'''Human residents direct the shared productive order rather than acting as wage-dependent clients of a private robot owner. The best-guess nonworking fraction is intermediate because technical security leaves room for useful art, care, research and community projects. Freely choosing a role does not make it nonwork. The broad interval is an editorial all-age scenario, not a statistic in the secondary economic account. The original material description remains provisional without claiming a new full-novel reading. This point concerns the settled colony rather than the founding robots alone or everyone arriving from an outside society with different institutions.''',
['Robotic production and plentiful energy support settled Chiron’s nonmonetary material arrangements.']),
('prime-intellect-cyberlife',{'nonworking':(.75,[.35,.98],'Active-human-person scenario under removable physical needs; art, science, care and sustained socially useful activity still count. Bodies and copies are not multiplied.')},
'''Prime Intellect retains decisive authority over the environments sustaining human persons. The high nonworking best guess follows the removal of necessity labor, while allowing useful art, science, care and chosen projects. Being able to avoid work does not establish that everyone actually does. The wide interval applies to active persons rather than the number of bodies one can instantiate. A preserved body or dormant representation never becomes an extra leisure citizen. The very strong guarantee point concerns maintained existence and provision, not happiness, equal influence over Prime Intellect or a promise that every experienced world is psychologically satisfying.''',
['Prime Intellect sustains active human persons and configurable environments without ordinary employment or purchase.']),
('gentle-seduction-interstellar',{'nonworking':(.4,[.05,.8],'Active human-descended person scenario counts guidance, exploration, art, care and psychological engineering; simultaneous bodies do not multiply people.')},
'''Control favors participants’ substantial ability to direct their environments, qualified by the story’s limited institutional detail. The intermediate nonworking best guess reflects freedom from routine subsistence while retaining useful guiding, exploration, care, art and psychological engineering as work. Long lives and many simultaneous bodies do not supply a headcount, so the denominator remains active persons. The broad interval allows much more or less chosen participation than the protagonist demonstrates. This is the late community’s material order, not its earlier paid employment and medical purchases. No universal right for outsiders or a census of every recognized synthetic descendant is invented.''',
['Self-reproducing nanomachines provide homes, bodies and travel infrastructure in the later human-descended community.']),
('erewhon-machine-ban',{'nonworking':(.2,[.05,.55],'Erewhonian all-age scenario retains labor after deliberate machine destruction, including farming, craft and care; dependents and others outside sustained roles remain included.')},
'''Human institutions retain practical authority and restrict which machines may be used. The low nonworking best guess assumes extensive continuing farming, craft, service and care, with dependents included. Fear of future superior machines does not establish an existing AI ruler. The broad interval is an editorial population scenario, not a number derived from how many devices were destroyed. This zero variant concerns deliberate technological restraint and retained work rather than proof that every remaining task could already be automated. Material security remains comparatively weak because useful inherited capacity has been restricted without an independently established universal floor.''',
['Erewhonians destroy advanced machinery, restrict innovation and keep remnants as antiquities.']),
('city-geneva-hobbies',{'nonworking':(.5,[.15,.9],'Awake Geneva all-age scenario allows free robotic provision but counts history, painting, design, care and useful chosen activity; the word hobbies is not a labor census.')},
'''Shared access and resident agency support the positive control estimate, while the productive apparatus does much routine work. The intermediate nonworking best guess avoids treating the narrator’s word hobbies as a statistical category. Sustained history writing, painting, design, care and useful projects count even without wages or subsistence pressure. A wide interval allows substantial chosen participation alongside leisure. The denominator is the living awake Geneva community, not sleepers, stored identities or all humans across the stories’ chronology. Goods available simply by asking establish material access more directly than they establish how residents choose to spend their productive lives.''',
['Geneva’s awake residents can obtain goods by asking or taking them from inherited machine provision.','The primary account depicts history writing, painting and design.']),
('grammatizator-contracted-authors',{'nonworking':(.6,[0,1],'Actual adult signatories only: assume many do not take another sustained role, but the full interval allows all or none to do useful work beyond forbidden writing. Contract uptake is not participation.')},
'''Corporate owners retain control of the automatic publisher, leaving signatories dependent on a private lifetime promise. The central nonworking scenario assumes many contracted authors do not take another sustained role, but the interval deliberately spans zero to one because useful care, another profession or a chosen project is not forbidden. This is an adult contract cohort, not the authors’ families or all society. Neither the share signing nor the share of fiction produced is used as the fraction not working. The modest guarantee point also remains conditional on payment adequacy and company reliability rather than a documented universal necessities floor.''',
['Authors actually sign lifetime-payment agreements requiring them to stop writing under their own effort.']),
('multivac-life-settled-earth',{'nonworking':(.65,[.25,.95],'Living-human all-age scenario under automatic farming, mining and manufacture; permitted life-work, mathematics, care and chosen useful projects still count.')},
'''Multivac’s practical control places the order near autonomous AI authority, with material dependence as a qualification to security. The high nonworking best guess permits many people to avoid ongoing useful work while retaining mathematics, care, creative contribution and permitted life-work. Comfortable lives and a robot population do not measure that participation. The denominator is the living human community, including families and descendants, rather than a ratio of machines to people. The interval remains broad because the primary account provides examples instead of a census. The later shutdown and earlier catastrophes are not averaged into this settled period.''',
['The settled living human population receives machine-directed farming, mining, manufacturing and requested food.']),
('paradise-iron-supervision',{'nonworking':(.15,[.02,.55],'Mandatory recurring Supervision counts as work even if its levers are technically dummy controls; useful art and care also count. The all-age scenario allows dependents and uncertain duty coverage.')},
'''Machines enforce recurring Supervision, giving them substantial control despite the automatic goods supply. The low nonworking best guess counts that imposed duty as work even when its controls are technically dummy devices. Useful art and care also count. The broad interval allows dependents and uncertainty about who must attend, rather than claiming that ceremonial labor automatically makes everyone idle. This is why the material-abundance evidence can coexist with a zero-variant label: necessary production may be automatic while people remain obliged to work. The estimate is not the inverse of industrial staffing and does not pretend the source supplies a complete age or participation census.''',
['Automatic kitchens and industry supply ordinary goods.','Residents must perform recurring Supervision described as dummy levers and meters.']),
('threat-robot-labor-veto',{'nonworking':(.25,[.05,.65],'All-age affected-US scenario under recalled human employment; jobs count despite shorter hours, while care and informal contribution also count. Robot-replacement figures are not a census.')},
'''Ball’s privately directed observers and technical veto concentrate human control over which robot uses proceed. The modest nonworking best guess follows real rehiring while allowing dependents and people outside sustained work. Shorter hours do not make a recalled employee a nonworker, and care or useful informal activity can count without a wage. The broad interval is not calculated from the number of robots blocked or workers mentioned. This zero variant concerns an actual retreat from available labor replacement, with material security still linked to employment rather than a robot-funded unconditional floor. The veto’s declared future reach is kept distinct from what has already happened.''',
['Interrupted robot control causes employers to recall workers with higher pay and shorter hours.','Ball announces a continuing privately monitored veto.']),
('twilight-inhabited-cities',{'control':(.3,[-.6,.85],'Residents have routine controls and some recoverable reprogramming, but lack understanding; partial human agency is a wide best guess without asserting conscious AI sovereignty.')},
'''The control best guess gives some weight to accessible service controls and recoverable reprogramming while allowing much greater practical machine autonomy. Loss of understanding does not by itself establish a conscious sovereign AI, and nominal controls do not prove equal productive ownership. The interval therefore remains unusually wide. The existing high nonworking estimate reflects the reported passivity of living residents, with useful care, music and mathematical help retained as work. Empty automatic cities demonstrate capacity without adding leisure citizens. This interpretation stays bounded to inhabited communities rather than turning technological decline or vanished people into proof of complete human freedom from labor.''',
['Inhabited automatic cities supply food, clothing, transport and environmental care.','Some routine controls and recoverable reprogramming coexist with lost understanding.']),
('venus-plus-x-ledom',{'nonworking':(.4,[.1,.85],'Living Ledom all-age scenario allows effortless necessities while counting education, science, care and creative contribution; no-wage vocabulary does not measure participation.')},
'''The control estimate retains a mixture of shared life and influential specialists rather than a demonstrated sovereign AI. The intermediate nonworking best guess separates effortless provision from inactivity: education that contributes, science, care and creative work still count. Low necessary energy and the absence of wage language do not reveal a population percentage. The broad interval applies to living biologically modified human descendants, not extra copies or a visitor’s first impression. Material abundance remains strong while authority, coercion and the story’s revelations qualify the apparent social ideal. No new primary reading or canonical census is claimed by supplying this missing coordinate.''',
['Ledom’s A-field and cerebrostyle provide ordinary objects and remove scarcity of food, housing and clothing.','Residents retain education, science and care.']),
('woman-edge-time-mattapoisett',{'nonworking':(.2,[.05,.55],'All-age community scenario retains extensive farming, care, making, education and civic contribution. Machines reduce burdens but do not imply low participation.')},
'''Shared community institutions support the strong distributed-control point, with access organized around needs rather than wages. The low nonworking best guess preserves the large amount of useful farming, care, making, education and civic contribution still done by people. Shorter or safer work does not make its participants nonworkers. The wide interval allows children, dependents and sustained nonparticipants without inventing a demographic census. This is a partial post-work economy in the distributional sense: machines help remove wage dependence even when most adults contribute. Neither sabbaticals nor the automated share of tasks is converted directly into the third coordinate.''',
['Mattapoisett combines shared basics and selective automation with continued farming, care and making.']),
('female-man-whileaway',{'control':(.7,[.15,.95],'Worker-directed cybernetic production suggests broadly shared organic agency; coercion and binding institutions limit confidence in equally distributed authority.'),'nonworking':(.15,[.02,.5],'All-age Whileawayan scenario under strong work obligations; shorter formal hours still count as work, as does caregiving. Conflicting accounts are not a census.')},
'''The control best guess favors broad worker agency over cybernetic production, while leaving substantial uncertainty about binding authority and unequal institutional power. Work refusal is not merely a private lifestyle choice, which limits any effortless-commons reading. The low nonworking estimate counts formal duties and useful care even when a week is short, rather than converting saved hours into people who never work. Its interval allows dependents and the source’s conflicting descriptions. The zero variant remains openly disputed: high productive capacity and shared machines can coexist with obligations, but no claim is made that every remaining useful task is technically pointless.''',
['Induction technology lets one worker direct very large productive capacity.','Work obligations and contradictory short-week versus incessant-toil descriptions coexist.']),
('accelerando-economics-two-human-remnant',{'nonworking':(.65,[.2,.98],'Only active surviving human-derived persons are counted; obsolete market roles allow large displacement, while useful care, defense, programming and other chosen activity continue.')},
'''The high nonworking best guess reflects the loss of viable human market roles while retaining useful care, defense, programming and chosen contribution among active survivors. It is not a count of people being destroyed or the share of planetary matter converted into computation. Restored persons enter the denominator only when active, and damaged resurrection is not a secure material right. The broad interval preserves uncertainty about actual participation. Autonomous economic entities hold productive power with very weak human protection, so this point illustrates exclusion amid immense output rather than a comfortable post-scarcity leisure society.''',
['Autonomous superhuman economic entities transform the inner system and undermine human economic roles.','Author commentary describes destructive and damaged restoration.']),
('glasshouse-invisible-republic',{'nonworking':(.5,[.15,.9],'Active human-derived resident scenario under assembler access; research, services, care and chosen useful roles remain work, while inactive backups are excluded.')},
'''The positive control point recognizes substantial resident access and agency while leaving limits around money and scarce services. The intermediate nonworking best guess allows freedom from necessity production but still counts useful research, care, services and chosen projects. Assembler ownership or an optional job does not supply a participation census. The denominator is active human-derived residents rather than dormant backups or every possible body. A broad interval admits very different choices within the protected society. The imposed scarcity inside the Glasshouse is kept as a distinct institutional regime, rather than assigning the outside polity’s fabrication rights to confined experimental participants.''',
['Residents of the outside polity can use assemblers for structures and everyday goods.','The sharp fabrication restrictions belong to the separate experiment.']),
('glasshouse-experimental-polity',{'nonworking':(.2,[.05,.55],'Active confined participants: assigned jobs count even if organizers could automate them; useful care and informal roles also count. A job title does not measure hours or ages.')},
'''Human experiment directors concentrate control and deliberately restrict productive access. The low nonworking best guess counts assigned jobs as work even when the organizers possess machines that could replace them. Useful care and informal contribution also count without a wage. The broad interval allows participants outside sustained roles and uncertainty about coverage, rather than inventing an all-person census from the period’s job labels. This zero variant therefore records actual manufactured dependence, not a technological inability to provide. The outside society’s much freer assembler access is a separate system and does not make the closed experiment’s material insecurity disappear.''',
['Experiment directors restrict available fabricators and impose jobs, money and social roles.']),
('singularity-sky-rochard-cornucopias',{'nonworking':(.55,[.15,.9],'Living resident scenario after cornucopia diffusion allows relief from necessity labor while counting stories, care, rebuilding and useful projects. Machine distribution is not participation.')},
'''Widespread cornucopias shift productive control toward residents rather than the old owners, while disorder limits how secure access becomes. The substantial nonworking best guess follows reduced necessity labor but counts useful storytelling, care, rebuilding and chosen projects. The Festival’s initial exchange terms are not themselves a census of what residents continue doing. Its wide interval also avoids treating every person receiving a machine as permanently idle. This point concerns the implemented colony transition, not the Festival’s own internal society or a fully stabilized future constitution. The earlier New Republic’s deliberate restrictions remain a different material model.''',
['Cornucopia machines actually spread among Rochard’s World inhabitants after the Festival arrives.']),
('singularity-sky-new-republic',{'nonworking':(.15,[.02,.55],'All-age colonial scenario under a maintained dependent workforce; peasants, workers, care and useful civic duties count even when technical alternatives exist.')},
'''Ruling institutions concentrate control and deliberately keep productive alternatives from the dependent population. The low nonworking best guess assumes broad useful participation by workers and peasants while including children and other nonparticipants. Care and civic duties count alongside wages, and retained jobs remain work even if rulers could replace them with technology. The interval is an editorial all-age scenario rather than a number inferred from one estate or the size of a military force. The later arrival of cornucopias changes that relationship and is scored separately; its benefits are not projected backward onto the earlier restricted order.''',
['The New Republic suppresses productive and information technologies to preserve a dependent workforce.']),
('permutation-city-elysium',{'nonworking':(.5,[.1,.95],'Active Copy-person scenario with secure self-expanding computation; research, art, care and useful world-building still count. No stored or duplicate body instances added.')},
'''Resident control over private worlds and a self-expanding substrate supports the shared-agency estimate. The intermediate nonworking best guess allows wide freedom from resource-earning jobs but retains useful research, art, care and world-building as work. An unlimited experienced landscape does not mean every active Copy chooses no sustained contribution. The broad interval is a person-level scenario, not a calculation from virtual time or computational capacity. Dormant files, instantiated bodies and unrelated beings do not enlarge the denominator. Elysium’s admission boundary remains explicit, and commercial Earth-hosted Copies are not assigned the same security simply because both populations are digital.''',
['Elysium’s active Copies use a self-replicating computational substrate rather than buying Earth-market cycles.']),
('permutation-city-commercial-copies',{'nonworking':(.4,[.05,.9],'Active commercial Copy scenario includes capital-supported leisure and useful earning or care activity; subjective speed, wealth and suspension are not work percentages.')},
'''Private hosting, assets and market access leave control only partly dispersed and protection weak for low-resource users. The moderate nonworking best guess permits asset-supported leisure while retaining paid or unpaid useful work, including creative, technical and care activity. Running more slowly does not make a person a nonworker, and suspended files are outside the active population. The broad interval is not a wealth-to-participation conversion or a measure of processor cycles. These Copies share digital embodiment with Elysium’s residents but have a materially different relationship to continued existence, so their market vulnerability remains a separate point.''',
['Commercial Copies buy computing resources and can face slower operation or suspension when they cannot afford them.']),
('diaspora-konishi',{'nonworking':(.3,[.05,.8],'Active Konishi-person scenario retains substantial mathematics, philosophy, art, care and other useful chosen projects despite non-wage computational provision.')},
'''Shared citizen agency and a non-sentient conceptory distinguish this order from an AI dictatorship or commercial hosting market. The modest nonworking best guess preserves the substantial useful mathematics, philosophy, art, care and chosen projects that citizens can pursue without wages. A person need not be supporting their own subsistence for that activity to count as work. The wide interval reflects uncertainty about everyone beyond the depicted thinkers. Active citizens, including home-born persons, form the denominator; possible bodies and inactive data do not. Strong provision therefore remains separate from an assumption that a technically abundant digital society must be largely idle.''',
['Konishi’s infrastructure supports active digital citizens and a non-sentient conceptory can create citizens without prior resource earnings.']),
('incandescence-amalgam',{'nonworking':(.5,[.1,.95],'Active human-derived participant scenario under cooperative self-replicating support; exploration, science, care and useful creation remain work. Alien members are context, not unmarked humans.')},
'''The cooperative network and participants’ agency support distributed control, with institutions inside the Aloof’s territory left separate. The intermediate nonworking best guess allows extensive release from necessity labor while counting useful exploration, science, care and creation. Long lives, easy travel and optional occupations do not supply a population activity count. The broad interval concerns active human-derived participants only; alien allies provide context and inactive information is not a leisure person. The strong floor describes access within the established network rather than a promise of equal resources for every outsider or permission to travel through every separate civilization.''',
['The Amalgam uses self-replicating infrastructure for data travel, environments and embodiment within a cooperative network.']),
('yellowstone-demarchy-preplague',{'nonworking':(.45,[.1,.9],'Living demarchic-system all-age scenario allows substantial automatic provision while retaining professions, research, care and civic participation. No inference from absent unemployment mentions.')},
'''Demarchic participation and technical access support shared human control while allowing differences among habitats. The intermediate nonworking best guess retains useful professions, research, care and civic contribution despite extensive automatic support. It is not inferred from a reference’s failure to mention unemployment or the sheer scale of orbital infrastructure. A broad interval allows varied resident choices and ages. The guarantee estimate remains a bounded reading of substantial abundance rather than an invented universal statute. The Melding Plague changes the material system, so destroyed communities and later urban misery are not averaged into the earlier living demarchic baseline.''',
['Preplague Yellowstone and participating habitats have extensive automatic infrastructure and demarchic institutions.']),
('void-higher-culture',{'nonworking':(.5,[.1,.95],'Active embodied Higher-citizen scenario under rejected commercial economics; useful science, care, governance and chosen roles continue. Long life is not a census.')},
'''The positive control estimate recognizes citizen agency alongside powerful infrastructure and influential actors. The intermediate nonworking best guess follows release from ordinary commercial subsistence while retaining useful science, care, governance, art and chosen projects. Biononic longevity does not enumerate participation, and optional work remains work. The broad interval applies to active embodied Higher citizens rather than every Commonwealth planet or personality stored in ANA. The later culture’s material institutions are therefore kept distinct from the early commercial Commonwealth and the uploaded community. No precise employment law or population statistic is invented merely to turn post-scarcity into a plotted point.''',
['The later Higher culture links biononic enrichment and rejection of commercial economics with established abundance.']),
('void-ana-community',{'nonworking':(.45,[.1,.9],'Active uploaded human-derived ANA scenario retains useful political, creative, care-like and technical contribution. Dormant backups do not become nonworkers.')},
'''The control point favors substantial shared human-derived agency, while the exact substrate and decision structure remain qualifications. The intermediate nonworking best guess permits freedom from bodily subsistence jobs but counts useful political, creative, care-like and technical contribution. Uploading does not make all activity idle, and voting or a single social interaction is not assumed to be a full-time profession. The broad interval is an active-person scenario rather than a processor or archive count. Embodied Higher residents form another scope, and neither dormant backups nor people who have not gained admission receive ANA’s estimated material security by default.''',
['ANA sustains active uploaded human personalities whose continuing experience is supported inside its computational system.']),
]
assert len(rows)==25,len(rows)
for rid,updates,paragraph,facts in rows:
 old=D['societies'][rid];r=deepcopy(old);refs=r['source_ids']
 assert all(r['axis'][k] is None for k in updates),rid
 for key,(value,bounds,basis) in updates.items():
  r['axis'][key]=value;r['axis_assessment'][key]=assessment(value,bounds,'low',basis,refs)
 first=old['description'].split('\n\n')[0]
 if rid=='woman-edge-time-mattapoisett':first=first.replace('The account does not establish what fraction of all residents do no work.','The participation percentage is an explicitly labeled editorial estimate.')
 if rid=='venus-plus-x-ledom':first=first.replace('so freedom from subsistence work supplies no reliable nonworking percentage.','so the nonworking point is an editorial estimate rather than a direct consequence of free necessities.')
 r['description']=first+'\n\n'+paragraph
 r.update(assessment_mode='best_guess',best_guess_axes=list(updates),qualification_basis='Earlier evidence-based inclusion retained; individually supply missing coordinates under the requested best-guess policy.',qualification_confidence='low',canon_facts=facts,editorial_assumptions=[v[2] for v in updates.values()])
 r['uncertainties']=[u for u in old['uncertainties'] if not any(t in u.lower() for t in ['remains unresolved','stays unresolved','cannot be considered complete','requires a separate editorial estimate'])]
 r['uncertainties'] += ['Coordinates are editorial scenarios, not canonical statistics; no new full-work reading claimed.']+r['editorial_assumptions']
 r['review'].update(date=DATE,coordinate_ready=True,method='Individual reference-led follow-up with explicit participation scenarios; no independent reviewer')
 assert all(v is not None for v in r['axis'].values()),rid
 assert len(r['description'].split())>=110,rid
 changes.append(change(D,'societies',r))

# Technically unnecessary assigned jobs still count as work. Correct three earlier explanations
# without replacing their deliberately broad central scenarios or pretending to have new census data.
fixes=[
 ('scythe-thunderhead-provision',
  'Deliberately retained formal employment complicates the picture: a ceremonial job need not be useful work, whereas an unpaid project may be.',
  'Deliberately retained formal jobs still count as work even when technically unnecessary, and useful unpaid projects also count.',
  'A large nonworking population is plausible under basic provision; retained jobs and useful unpaid contributions both count, and essential-production staffing is not participation.'),
 ('player-piano-pre-revolt',
  'Its participation best guess distinguishes useful assigned service from empty ceremony: some Army and public-work activity contributes, while a formal job title need not prove useful output.',
  'Its participation best guess counts assigned Army and public-work duties as work even when inefficient or technically replaceable, alongside useful unpaid contribution.',
  'Assigned Army/public-work duties count even if replaceable or partly ceremonial; useful unpaid contribution also counts. The broad all-age scenario allows dependents and nonparticipants.'),
 ('shape-second-council',
  'Empty formal activity is not automatically productive, so the interval is broader than an official employment target would suggest.',
  'Assigned duties still count as work when technically unnecessary, and the interval remains broad because an employment target does not give all-age coverage.',
  'A universal-employment aim supports broad adult participation, including assigned duties that machines could replace; the all-age scenario allows dependents and uncertain coverage.'),
]
for rid,before,after,basis in fixes:
 r=deepcopy(D['societies'][rid]);assert before in r['description'],rid
 r['description']=r['description'].replace(before,after)
 old_basis=r['axis_assessment']['nonworking']['basis'];r['axis_assessment']['nonworking']['basis']=basis
 r['editorial_assumptions']=[basis if u==old_basis else u for u in r['editorial_assumptions']]
 r['uncertainties']=[basis if u==old_basis else u for u in r['uncertainties']]
 r['participation_definition']='Assigned work counts even if technically unnecessary; useful voluntary and care contribution also count.'
 r['review']['method']+='; consistency check: retained assigned jobs count as work'
 changes.append(change(D,'societies',r))
write_revision(8,changes,'2026-10-17 coordinate completion: twenty-five earlier societies receive individual estimates. Three earlier explanations are corrected so assigned make-work counts as work alongside useful voluntary activity; no canonical labor statistics or changed central values are invented.')
